@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create a notification (deliver now)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-101",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Order Confirmed",
  "message": "Your order has been confirmed.",
  "priority": "Normal"
}

### Same request again -> 200 OK + X-Duplicate-Request: true, same id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-101",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Order Confirmed",
  "message": "Your order has been confirmed.",
  "priority": "Normal"
}

### High priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-101",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Password reset",
  "message": "Use this link to reset your password.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Scheduled for the future (stays Pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-101",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Reminder",
  "message": "Your subscription renews soon.",
  "priority": "Low",
  "requestedDeliveryTime": "2030-01-01T09:00:00Z"
}

### Provider failure demo (domain configured to always fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-101",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "someone@fail.example.com",
  "message": "This one will fail."
}

### Invalid request -> 400 with field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "not-an-email",
  "message": "",
  "priority": "Urgent",
  "requestedDeliveryTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Process due notifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/process

### Customer notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/CUST-101/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20

### Customer notifications, page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/CUST-101/notifications?page=2&pageSize=2

### Unknown id -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
